{
  "id": "1-7S",
  "chapter": 1,
  "order": 7.5,
  "kind": "challenge",
  "title": "支线挑战：更相减损求最大公约数（GCD）",
  "mode": "online",
  "allowLocalFile": true,
  "language": "asm",
  "prerequisites": ["1-7"],
  "parInstructions": 9,
  "concepts": ["gcd", "loop-invariant", "multi-branch"],
  "goalSummary": {
    "before": "t0 与 t1 为两个正整数（禁用乘除与取余指令）",
    "after": "用减法与循环求出两数的最大公约数，存入 t2"
  },
  "briefing": [
    {
      "tag": "硬核支线",
      "text": "本关禁用了乘除与取余，只能使用加减与跳转指令。"
    },
    {
      "tag": "经典算法",
      "text": "「更相减损术」：只要两个正整数不相等，就反复用大数减去小数，直到两数相等——那就是它们的**最大公约数**。"
    },
    {
      "tag": "通关目标",
      "text": "求出 `t0` 与 `t1` 的最大公约数，存入 `t2`。"
    }
  ],
  "sandbox": {
    "type": "manual-cpu",
    "modules": ["regs", "pcTrack"],
    "recordToAsm": true,
    "focusRegs": ["t0", "t1", "t2"],
    "regRoles": {
      "t0": "正整数 A",
      "t1": "正整数 B",
      "t2": "最大公约数"
    },
    "pcTrack": {
      "cases": [
        {
          "label": "gcd(12, 18) = 6",
          "initial": { "regs": { "t0": 12, "t1": 18, "t2": 0 } },
          "goal": { "regs": { "t2": 6 } }
        }
      ],
      "program": [
        { "label": "loop", "op": "blt", "a": "t0", "b": "t1", "target": "b_big", "asm": "blt t0, t1, b_big" },
        { "op": "blt", "a": "t1", "b": "t0", "target": "a_big", "asm": "blt t1, t0, a_big" },
        { "op": "mv", "dst": "t2", "src": "t0", "asm": "mv t2, t0" },
        { "op": "j", "target": "done", "asm": "j done" },
        { "label": "a_big", "op": "sub", "dst": "t0", "a": "t0", "b": "t1", "asm": "sub t0, t0, t1" },
        { "op": "j", "target": "loop", "asm": "j loop" },
        { "label": "b_big", "op": "sub", "dst": "t1", "a": "t1", "b": "t0", "asm": "sub t1, t1, t0" },
        { "op": "j", "target": "loop", "asm": "j loop" },
        { "label": "done", "op": "halt", "asm": "ecall" }
      ]
    },
    "warmupPuzzle": {
      "prompt": "反复用较大的数减去较小的数：(12, 18) → (12, 6) → (6, 6)，两数相等时即得最大公约数！",
      "initial": {
        "regs": { "t0": 12, "t1": 18, "t2": 0 }
      },
      "goal": {
        "regs": { "t2": 6 }
      }
    }
  },
  "editor": {
    "readonlyPrefix": 1,
    "readonlySuffix": 1
  },
  "hints": [
    { "level": 1, "type": "diagram", "content": "欧几里得更相减损法：若 a > b，则 gcd(a, b) = gcd(a - b, b)；反复相减直到 a == b，结果就是最大公约数。" },
    { "level": 2, "type": "steps", "content": "1. loop: 若 t0 < t1 跳去 t1 = t1 - t0；2. 若 t1 < t0 跳去 t0 = t0 - t1；3. 都不成立说明 t0 == t1，把 t0 放进 t2 跳到 done。" },
    { "level": 3, "type": "snippet", "content": "loop:\nblt t0, t1, b_big\nblt t1, t0, a_big\nmv  t2, t0\nj   done\na_big:\nsub t0, t0, t1\nj   loop\nb_big:\nsub t1, t1, t0\nj   loop\ndone:" }
  ],
  "wikiRefs": ["rv32-branch"]
}
